;;
;; Proof receipt of resource-algebra (PROOF-POLICY §8.5.1, profile
;; proof-receipt). It describes one source commit and the proofs.yml run on
;; it. Every :pwg here is the value the reader derives from the legs and
;; receipts (standards 1-formats/deed/tools/deed_lint.js --proof-receipt-json);
;; the reader refuses a recorded grade that differs. The rows and their
;; statement correspondence are in docs/status/PROOF-STATUS.adoc.
;; Each current receipt lists its input manifest and digest (PROOF-POLICY
;; §8.5.1) and its axioms (none: Agda is --safe, Rocq and Lean print
;; closed/axiom-free for every theorem; the proofs.yml run gates this).
;; Only the Rocq receipts name an :image (pinned by digest), so no row is
;; PWG-1 (§8.2; docs/status/PROOF-STATUS.adoc). The Lean job checks the leg
;; and the M-2 bridge in one run, so every Lean leg shares one receipt and
;; its (import …) of tropical-types.
;; A later commit that changes src/ or a recheck leg is not described here.
(praxis-deed
  :schema-version "1.0.0"
  :canonical-name "resource-algebra-proof-receipt"
  :beholding-chora #u8"chora:estate/github.com/hyperpolymath"
  :profile proof-receipt
